rooms_desc ({"The entrance to THRUD'S cavern, to the east there is the pub(very noisy). To the west the lounge, and to the north loud hammering is heard (ask before entering). If for any reason you would like to venture round this cavern, please ask permission first.","The pub is small but packed full of dwarves. Troll slayers are at a table in the corner (avoid, a fight may occur at any time). Anrox the norse dwarf, friend of Thrud, can get u a beer or even a WHISKEY! Enjoy the beer and get pissed.","This is Thrud's weapons/armour room, you may if you have approval leave yourweapons/armour here and Thrud or Gratnir his Runesmith will resharpen orcreate you a better one. From behind the north door loud hammerings can beheard. All around this room there are racks of swords, spears, hammers, axes,some of which are double handed. Shields and amulets litter the floor, aboxful of BMA's lie in the corner.","Numerous comfy seats are found here, pull one up and watch troll slaying on     satellite. Don't disturb the dwarves in the front row with the mohican hair     cuts or you may not feel well. Sit back and enjoy.","This room is a Runsmiths, a runesmith is different from an ordinaryblacksmith. Different in that a Runesmith has the ability to add powerfulmagical runes to his weapons. Elven/Human/Orc etc. wizards have the abilityto use magic, dwarfs cannot. Instead dwarfs are able to use the old andmagical lore, passed down from runesmith to runesmith. This rune magic iseasily as powerful as any magic used by any wizard. Gratnir is Thrud'srunesmith, and he has an apprentice called Dimplar. If you search long enoughyou may find a secret door hidden at the back of the room, it is locked.Maybe Thrud has a key.","This is the main General HQ of the ULSTER VOLUNTEER FORCE (UVF), who are asplinter group of the ULSTER DEFENCE ARMY (UDA). There primary and onlyobjective is to wipe out the IRA and all related fenian terroristorganizations, so that N.Ireland can be at peace and remain within theUnited Kingdom (UK). The room is spatious with lots of maps everywhere.n a corner there are numerous weapons, and balaclavas. The RUC contact is coordinating an attack on known IRA terrorists. Out the window there is anarmy pig standing by. You get frisked as you enter, no weapons please inhere, and are a fenian?","There is a king size dwarf bed, by the northern wall. It has not been sleptin for the last week, due to the pub not closing at all. There is a razorclogged up with hair lying on the chest of drawers. You conclude that Thrudhas been trimming his beard. Why don't you compliment him on how good itlooks. You hear all kinds of groans, and the squeaking of springs, with wordslike `YES, YES , YES.' or `I WANT IT NOW BIG BOY' coming from the western door.","This room is bigger than the bedroom, the walls are covered from floor to ceiling (and that too) with mirrors. In the middle of the room there is a shallow pool (3ft at this end, 6ft at the other- dwarfs are not reknowned for swimming). BUT the one thing that captures your eyes are the amount of femaleshere (approx. 15-even Thrud doesn't know). All of these females are beautifuland are wearing not a heck of a lot. Your mind has a brain wave (and thatdoesn't happen a lot, does it?), this is a HAREM! Thrud allows you to get friendly with the girls, there are plenty of beds and condoms foreverybody. The female dwarf brunette is Thrud's personal girl (so leave her alone, she has a suhi knife!)","Thrud has to study for his degree, so he thought if he built a geographyroom in the mud, he might get some work done (no logic to this, but...).Maps of Paphos and other exotic places visited by Thrud on his travels such as Dunfanaghy. If you look round you will not see a radiator in sight (forobvious reasons, ask Thrud).","The cavern is BIG, and there is a wide round pit in the middle, with tiersupon tiers of rows of seats. The place is jam packed with more dwarfs, whohave come to watch the brave, the pissed, the unlucky and the stupid fight tothe death. There are bookies all around the pit at the front, who will takeany bet you wish to place. NO I.O.U.'s will be taken. To get in it costs 5coins.Everytype of fighting occurs here, do you want to fight? You can hereAltern-8 playing in the background, isn't it good. Enjoy.",})
rooms_short ({"WELCOME TO THRUD'S CAVERN (beware low ceilings, trolls and elves beware!)","The DWARVES RETURN pub. All Trolls/Ogres/Orcs/Goblins enter at your peril.","WEAPONS ROOM - YOU MAY DEPOSIT WEAPONS/ARMOUR FOR THEM TO BE RENEWED.","LOUNGE AREA WHERE ONE CAN RELAX AND WATCH TROLL SLAYING ON SKY TV.","THIS MAY SEEM LIKE A BLACKSMITHS BUT IS IN FACT A RUNESMITHS","OPERATIONS ROOM FOR THE U.V.F (ULSTER VOLUNTEER FORCE=PROTESTANT/LOYALIST)","BEDROOM WHERE THRUD GOES TO SLEEP AFTER A HARD DAYS MUDDING.","A HAREM - THE GIRLS ARE FOR FUN, VIOLENCE IS A CRIME!","THE GEOGRAPHY ROOM WHERE THRUD STUDIES FOR HIS DEGREE (NOT!).","A LARGE CAVERN WITH A WIDE PIT IN THE MIDDLE - THE FIGHTING PIT",})
